# Copy to ".env.dev" and fill in. Never put real values in this example file.
# ".env.dev" and ".env.prod" are ignored by .gitignore and must stay off the phone app.
#
# Phase 1 needs NO secrets. Only the project reference, which is not secret:
SUPABASE_PROJECT_REF=your-commit-dev-project-ref

# Public address of the API for this environment (used by the live check):
COMMIT_API_BASE=https://your-commit-dev-project-ref.supabase.co/functions/v1/api

# Phase 3 needs server-only secrets. They are NOT stored in this folder.
# They are set in Supabase (Edge Functions -> Secrets) under these names:
#   COMMIT_RECOVERY_SECRET_V1          a long random value (64 hex characters)
#   COMMIT_RECOVERY_CURRENT_VERSION    1
# A later rotation adds COMMIT_RECOVERY_SECRET_V2 and sets the current version
# to 2; see docs/PHASE3_DESIGN.md section 5a. Never put a key in Flutter, in
# this file or in any message.
#
# SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are provided to Edge Functions by
# Supabase itself and are never written down here.
